      section: "CS",
      q: "Consider the pushdown automaton (PDA) P below, which runs on the input alphabet {a,b}, has stack alphabet {⊥,A}, and has three states {s,p,q}, with s being the start state. A transition from state u to state v, labelled c/X/γ, where c is an input symbol or ε, X is a stack symbol, and γ is a string of stack symbols, represents the fact that in state u, the PDA can read c from the input, with X on the top of its stack, pop X from the stack, push in the string γ on the stack, and go to state v. In the initial configuration, the stack has only the symbol ⊥ in it. The PDA accepts by empty stack.\nTransitions: s self-loop on a/⊥/A⊥ and a/A/AA; s→p on b/A/ε; p self-loop on b/A/ε; s→q on ε/A/ε; p→q on ε/A/ε; q self-loop on ε/A/ε and ε/⊥/ε.\nWhich one of the following options correctly describes the language accepted by P?",
      figure: "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 240\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:420px;height:auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"ah-2023cs30\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"25\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#ah-2023cs30)\"/><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"90\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\">s</text><path d=\"M30,78 Q40,55 50,78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#ah-2023cs30)\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\">a/⊥/A⊥</text><text x=\"8\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\">a/A/AA</text><circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"90\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\">p</text><line x1=\"54\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#ah-2023cs30)\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\">b/A/ε</text><path d=\"M200,78 Q210,55 220,78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#ah-2023cs30)\"/><text x=\"198\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\">b/A/ε</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"119\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\">q</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"113\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#ah-2023cs30)\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\">ε/A/ε</text><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"137\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#ah-2023cs30)\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\">ε/A/ε</text><path d=\"M115,192 Q100,215 120,220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#ah-2023cs30)\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\">ε/A/ε</text><text x=\"85\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\">ε/⊥/ε</text></svg>",
      options: ["{aᵐbⁿ | 1 ≤ m and n < m}","{aᵐbⁿ | 0 ≤ n ≤ m}","{aᵐbⁿ | 0 ≤ m and 0 ≤ n}","{aᵐ | 0 ≤ m} ∪ {bⁿ | 0 ≤ n}"],
      answer: 0,
